<title>UK: ICI Q3 pre-tax pre-excep profits slump.</title>
<headline>ICI Q3 pre-tax pre-excep profits slump.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>third quarter 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr pre-excep (pence)  10.5		   vs 20.1</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excep	 131		    vs 248</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,668		  vs 2,622</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 127.0 million to 140.0 million stg.  </p>
<p> Trading profit	   147		    vs 260</p>
<p> Exceptional		6 (loss)	     vs 32 (loss)</p>
<p> Interest payable	 22		     vs 17</p>
<p> Tax			  41		     vs 80</p>
<p> Net profit		 70		     vs 117</p>
<p>NOTE - Imperial Chemical Industries Plc said the exceptional loss of six million stg related to minor divestments, principally the U.S. textile auxiliaries business.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
